{"sections":[{"slug":"Dedekind整环","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Dedekind整环"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Dedekind <span lang=\"zh\">整环</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Dedekind 整环”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>Dedekind <span lang=\"zh\">整环</span> $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">的谱</span> $\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">可理解为光滑曲线</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">在每点</span> $\\mathfrak p$ <span lang=\"zh\">处</span>, $\\mathcal O$ <span lang=\"zh\">的局部化</span> $\\mathcal O_{\\mathfrak p}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/离散赋值环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">离散赋值环</span>"}},{"Plain":", $\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathcal O_{\\mathfrak p}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\mathfrak p$ <span lang=\"zh\">附近的无穷小邻域</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">不是</span> Dedekind <span lang=\"zh\">整环的例子</span>: $\\mathbb{C}[x,y]/(y^2-x^3)$, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑其素理想</span> $\\mathfrak p_0=(x,y)$, <span lang=\"zh\">局部环唯一的极大理想</span> $\\mathfrak p_0\\mathcal O_{\\mathfrak p_0}$ <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $x,y$ <span lang=\"zh\">生成</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但不能由一个元素生成</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}